                "text": "Weglot turns 10 in 2026. A full decade. That's wild to say out loud.\n\nWe're closing a chapter and opening a 𝘣𝘪𝘨 one, with a lot of new product news coming soon.\n\nAnd the team genuinely can’t wait to share what we’ve been building.\n\nBut to do that well, we need someone new, right between Product and Marketing, turning what we build into value that users actually understand.\n\nWe're hiring our 𝘃𝗲𝗿𝘆 𝗳𝗶𝗿𝘀𝘁 𝗣𝗿𝗼𝗱𝘂𝗰𝘁 𝗠𝗮𝗿𝗸𝗲𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗠𝗮𝗻𝗮𝗴𝗲𝗿\n\nIt’s a brand new role, with a lot to build!\n\nWhich is amazing if you enjoy shaping things, asking the right questions, and building alongside a strong Product team.\n\nYou’ll work closely with Justine Poggi, Enea, Jeanne, Henri, Andreas, and Rémy.\n\nAnd a bit with the Marketing team and me too, for better or worse ^^\n\nHere’s the job offer if you’re curious:\n<https:\/\/lnkd.in\/e3XQEaUn>",
